NAME
    osarch-set - compatibility interface for platform selection

SYNOPSIS
    osarch-set
    osarch-set <osarch>

DESCRIPTION
    osarch-set is retained for compatibility with the previous platform
    selection command surface.

    With no operands it is equivalent to:
        osarch update

    With one <osarch> operand it is equivalent to:
        osarch set <osarch>

    New callers should use osarch directly.

EXIT STATUS
    The exit status is the status returned by the corresponding osarch operation.
